{"seq":1,"slug":"logistics-fundamentals","title":"物流管理基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/logistics-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-logistics","title":"大学物流管理 — 什么是物流","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/logistics-fundamentals/what-is-logistics","wordCount":1631,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"logistics-system-and-cost","title":"大学物流管理 — 物流系统与总成本","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/logistics-fundamentals/logistics-system-and-cost","wordCount":1599,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"logistics-performance-metrics","title":"大学物流管理 — 物流绩效指标","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/logistics-fundamentals/logistics-performance-metrics","wordCount":1600,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"物流管理基础\">物流管理基础</h1><p>物流不是单一的&quot;运输&quot;，而是一个由多个功能环节组成的系统。本章先厘清物流的定义、范围和七大功能，再带你认识物流系统的整体结构与&quot;总成本&quot;思想，最后介绍如何用关键绩效指标衡量一个物流系统的好坏。</p>\n<p>这三节课构成了理解物流管理的地基。掌握了&quot;系统观&quot;和&quot;总成本观&quot;，你才能跳出&quot;只看运费&quot;的局部视角，理解为什么有时候多花运费反而能让总成本更低——这正是物流管理最反直觉、也最有价值的洞见。</p>\n"}